Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:53.95,1:36:57.39,65c918be3c1aff8c346007a3,Bobuk,0,0,0,,2.6.29.6, Патрик Бог.
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:57.43,1:36:57.77,65c918be3c1aff8c346007a4,Bobuk,0,0,0,,Желепси 2.9.
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:57.97,1:37:00.91,65c918be3c1aff8c346007a5,Umputun,0,0,0,,4.3.3, не забудь.
